{"id":10593,"title":"65 | 参考资源和后续课程预览","content":"本课程作为微服务网关模块的收官之作，系统梳理了核心参考资源、主流网关产品选型及后续课程规划。学习网关架构应优先研读 Netflix 官方博客关于 Zuul 1.0 起源、异步非阻塞优化实践及 Zuul 2.0 开源特性的三篇技术文章，并结合 Spring Cloud 官方文档掌握封装用法。架构设计层面，推荐参考 Netflix 全球架构与边界聚合策略的 SlideShare PPT，深入理解网关在微服务体系中的定位与高级应用场景。源码研究方面，除 GitHub 官方仓库外，可结合定制教学版代码消化生产经验。在产品选型上，除 Java 体系的 Zuul 外，基于 Nginx/OpenResty 的高性能 Kong 网关适合对性能要求极高且具备 Lua/C 开发能力的团队；Tyk 采用核心开源加商业支持模式，适合需要企业级服务的场景；国内悟空网关与小报网关则提供了本土化的商业解决方案。至此，认证授权、配置中心与服务网关三大基础模块已全部讲解完毕，构建了完整的服务安全与运行时支撑体系。后续课程将围绕服务容错与服务监控展开深度剖析，进一步完善微服务基础架构与实践的技术版图。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":21511,"user_name":"冰封无名","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1081310,"ip_address":"","ucode":"EB212C047FD415","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/7f/de/7d17e15b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1535124819,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":8124,"content":"谢支持🌹加油💪","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1535864453,"ip_address":"","comment_id":21511,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"值得学习","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":422713,"discussion_content":"谢支持🌹加油💪","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1535864453,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":75776,"user_name":"Geek_0quh3e","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1226196,"ip_address":"","ucode":"0629888E7A5E16","user_he